<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-sick-wnt-dkk-hair-follicle-model-fidelity> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Sick et al. (2006) & Andl et al. (2002) WNT/DKK reaction-diffusion hair follicle spacing, secondary wave insertion & transgenic phenotypes — Model fidelity to source: 94/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-19"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "Faithfully implements Sick et al. (2006) saturating Meinhardt-Gierer WNT/DKK activator-inhibitor PDEs with exact unsaturated steady state (w_* = 1.5, h_* = 2.25), reaction Jacobian J_0 (tr = -0.01 < 0, det = +0.0006 > 0), critical diffusivity ratio d_c = (sqrt(2)+1)^2 = 5.828427, 1D primary wave -> 2x epidermal expansion -> secondary inter-follicular wave insertion (Figs. 3-4, L288-340, 4 -> 8 peaks), and 2D Wild-Type, K14-Wnt overexpression, saturated enlarged/ringing, Dkk1 blockade, and equal-diffusion control regimes (L456-515). Backed by 3 machine-checked Lean 4 theorems in `Loop_006_wnt_dkk_hair_follicle.lean`." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-model-fidelity> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> ;
    pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/model-fidelity" ;
    pk:hasEvidence <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-sick-wnt-dkk-hair-follicle-model-fidelity-1>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-sick-wnt-dkk-hair-follicle-model-fidelity-2>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-sick-wnt-dkk-hair-follicle-model-fidelity-3> ;
    pk:hasScore 9.4e-01 ;
    pk:hasVerdict "faithful" .

<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-sick-wnt-dkk-hair-follicle-morphometric-validation> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Sick et al. (2006) & Andl et al. (2002) WNT/DKK reaction-diffusion hair follicle spacing, secondary wave insertion & transgenic phenotypes — Morphometric validation: 92/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-19"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "`measure_morphoeval()` (L741-824) computes 7 quantitative morphometrics with literature/specimen reference values, uncertainty statistics (CV, std, RMSE, Pearson r), and negative-control delta: d_c = 5.8284 (ref 5.8284), w_* = 1.5 (ref 1.5), secondary inter-follicular wave doubling ratio 2.0 (ref 2.0, 4 -> 8 peaks, CV = 0.0354), 2D Wild-Type placode count 16 vs segmented Mus musculus specimen 16 placodes (PDE NN CV = 0.3062 vs specimen NN CV = 0.3234), K14-Wnt++ overexpression density ratio 2.0 (32 vs 16 placodes; saturated regime +45.0% placode area), Dkk1++ blockade + equal-diffusion control placode count 0 (ref 0, std = 3.60e-6), and domain scaling r = 0.9846 (RMSE = 0.3545 peaks)." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-morphometric-validation> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> ;
    pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/morphometric-validation" ;
    pk:hasEvidence <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-sick-wnt-dkk-hair-follicle-measurement-allometric-epidermal-domain-length-scaling-correlation-r-l-n-peaks>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-sick-wnt-dkk-hair-follicle-measurement-secondary-inter-follicular-wave-placode-doubling-ratio-upon-2x-epidermal-expansion>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-sick-wnt-dkk-hair-follicle-measurement-transgenic-dkk1-overexpression-blockade-equal-diffusion-negative-control-placode-count>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-sick-wnt-dkk-hair-follicle-measurement-transgenic-k14-wnt-overexpression-vs-wild-type-placode-density-ratio>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-sick-wnt-dkk-hair-follicle-measurement-unsaturated-steady-state-wnt-activator-concentration-w>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-sick-wnt-dkk-hair-follicle-measurement-wild-type-2d-hair-follicle-placode-count-vs-mus-musculus-in-situ-specimen-panel-b>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-sick-wnt-dkk-hair-follicle-measurement-wnt-dkk-critical-diffusivity-ratio-d-c-sqrt-2-1-2>,
