    pk:hasVerdict "faithful" .

<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-sick-wnt-dkk-hair-follicle-overall> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Sick et al. (2006) & Andl et al. (2002) WNT/DKK reaction-diffusion hair follicle spacing, secondary wave insertion & transgenic phenotypes — MorphoEval overall 92.2/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-19"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "Pass 2 (v2) evaluation of `2002-sick-wnt-dkk-hair-follicle.py` (91.9/100, up +36.4 from 55.5/100 in Pass 1). The remediated script implements Sick et al.'s (2006) saturating Meinhardt-Gierer WNT/DKK activator-inhibitor PDEs, exact Jacobian and dispersion analysis (d_c = (sqrt(2)+1)^2 = 5.8284), 1D primary wave (E14.5, 4 peaks) -> 2x epidermal expansion -> secondary inter-follicular wave insertion (E16.5, 8 peaks, exact 2.0x doubling, CV = 0.0354), 2D Wild-Type placode lattice (16 placodes, NN spacing CV = 0.3062), K14-Wnt overexpression hyper-density (32 placodes, 2.0x WT), saturated enlarged follicles (+45.0% area), Dkk1 transgenic alopecia blockade (0 placodes, Andl et al. 2002), equal-diffusion negative control (0 placodes, std = 3.60e-6), ectopic Dkk1 dose-response and allometric domain-length sweeps (r = 0.9846), and automated optical-density segmentation + Delaunay neighbor graph of the 16 placodes in Panel B of the vendored Mus musculus whole-mount in situ hybridization specimen. Overall 92.2/100 (faithfulness 91.9, reproducibility 93.0); rubric morphoeval 0.1.0; checkpoint commit 3cb5ea9; environment: python 3.14.7, numpy 2.4.2, scipy 1.17.0, matplotlib 3.10.8, Pillow 12.1.1. Dimension assessments: Model fidelity to source 94, Morphological realism / specimen match 91, Parameter expressivity 90, Morphometric validation 92, Source and data traceability 95, Code-to-model traceability 92, Reproducibility package 92. Output judged: docs/media/wnt_dkk_hair_follicle_comparison.png: rendered output of 2002-sick-wnt-dkk-hair-follicle.py at 3cb5ea9, image/png, 716789 B, 2227×1863 px, artifact_sha256 0fda4446cf9f1dbec59986ac22e8d05c70c4270ab8dfcd35bdb3ffe6fea47573 (sha256 0fda4446cf9f1dbec59986ac22e8d05c70c4270ab8dfcd35bdb3ffe6fea47573), spec_fingerprint b199744003e12310e28662e653c933212ba7a7794558fe627f0cafadb3ab526e. Dual provenance: spec_fingerprint: b199744003e12310e28662e653c933212ba7a7794558fe627f0cafadb3ab526e; artifact_sha256: 0fda4446cf9f1dbec59986ac22e8d05c70c4270ab8dfcd35bdb3ffe6fea47573; input_dataset_sha256: {datasets/wnt_dkk_hair_follicle/hair_follicle_placode_specimen.jpg=f48a7d76ae5984e5..., datasets/wnt_dkk_hair_follicle/paper_citations.bib=473c1747b6bcb451..., datasets/wnt_dkk_hair_follicle/scout_manifest.json=39fe775496e89c51..., datasets/wnt_dkk_hair_follicle/wnt_dkk_hair_follicle_reference.json=81d2042bc833768a...}. Supersedes audit: 2026-10-19-wnt-dkk-hair-follicle-audit." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-rubric-0.1.0> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> ;
    pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/overall" ;
    pk:evidenceAgainst "remediation needed: Couple the 2D epidermal WNT/DKK reaction-diffusion sheet to a 3D dermal condensate mesenchymal chemotaxis (FGF20/BMP4) model to simulate hair peg downgrowth following placode specification." ;
    pk:hasScore 9.22e-01 ;
    pk:hasVerdict "faithful" .

<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-sick-wnt-dkk-hair-follicle-parameter-expressivity> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
